---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Why This Exists — OurOrigin" 
  description="OurOrigin is a proof system. Not a spice company. Not a supply chain. A proof system."
>
  <main class="why-page">

    <!-- Beat 1 -->
    <section class="manifesto-beat" data-reveal="fade">
      <p class="wide-statement">
        OurOrigin is not a spice company.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Beat 2 -->
    <section class="manifesto-beat" data-reveal="fade">
      <p class="wide-statement">
        It is a proof system.
      </p>
      <p class="wide-qualifier">
        It proves that something real happened between a place and the person who understood it.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Beat 3 -->
    <section class="manifesto-beat" data-reveal="fade">
      <p class="wide-statement">
        The hands that grow the world's most exceptional yields are the ones farthest from its reward.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Beat 4 -->
    <section class="manifesto-beat" data-reveal="fade">
      <p class="wide-statement">
        We exist to collapse the distance between the forest and the final cup.
      </p>
      <p class="wide-qualifier">
        By creating a direct, transparent ledger, we ensure that the value remains where the effort originates.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Beat 5 -->
    <section class="manifesto-beat" data-reveal="fade">
      <p class="wide-statement">
        This isn't a supply chain.
      </p>
      <p class="wide-qualifier">
        It's a transfer of dignity, directly from the soil to you.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Beat 6 — the seven dimensions condensed -->
    <section class="manifesto-beat manifesto-beat--dense" data-reveal="fade">
      <div class="dimension-list">
        <span class="dimension-item">Geography</span>
        <span class="dimension-item">Biology</span>
        <span class="dimension-item">Community</span>
        <span class="dimension-item">Method</span>
        <span class="dimension-item">Observation</span>
        <span class="dimension-item">Time</span>
        <span class="dimension-item">Product</span>
      </div>
      <p class="wide-qualifier">
        Seven dimensions. Each one verified. Each one traceable.
        Together, they are the definition of an origin.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Beat 7 — closing -->
    <section class="manifesto-beat" data-reveal="fade">
      <p class="wide-statement">
        The origin remains the protagonist.
      </p>
      <p class="wide-closer">
        Always.
      </p>
    </section>

    <div class="manifesto-return">
      <a href="/" class="return-link">← Back to the origins</a>
    </div>

  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .why-page {
    min-height: 100vh;
    background-color: var(--color-forest-deep);
    color: var(--color-warm-cream);
    padding: 0;
  }

  .manifesto-beat {
    min-height: 80vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: var(--space-4xl) clamp(2rem, 10vw, 12rem);
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  .wide-statement {
    font-family: var(--font-narrative);
    font-size: clamp(26px, 5vw, 42px);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--color-warm-cream);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .wide-qualifier {
    font-family: var(--font-narrative);
    font-size: var(--type-narrative);
    color: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.6);
    line-height: var(--line-height-loose);
    margin: var(--space-2xl) 0 0 0;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .wide-closer {
    font-family: var(--font-narrative);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: var(--type-statement);
    color: var(--color-gold);
    margin: var(--space-xl) 0 0 0;
  }

  /* Dense — the seven dimensions */
  .manifesto-beat--dense {
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .dimension-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-lg) var(--space-2xl);
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3xl);
  }

  .dimension-item {
    font-family: var(--font-evidence);
    font-size: var(--type-evidence);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: var(--color-gold);
    padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-lg);
    border: 1px solid rgba(198, 156, 82, 0.3);
  }

  .manifesto-return {
    padding: var(--space-4xl) clamp(2rem, 10vw, 12rem);
  }

  .return-link {
    font-family: var(--font-evidence);
    font-size: var(--type-evidence);
    color: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.4);
    text-decoration: none;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    transition: color var(--duration-standard) var(--ease-settle);
  }

  .return-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-warm-cream);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .manifesto-beat {
      min-height: 70vh;
      padding: var(--space-3xl) var(--space-xl);
    }

    .dimension-list {
      gap: var(--space-md);
    }
  }
</style>
